# .protected-files — Files requiring architect review before changes
#
# List file paths or patterns (one per line).
# Any change to these files triggers mandatory architect (opus) review.
# run-architect.sh reads this file; create-pr.sh enforces the gate.
#
# Format:
#   - One path or grep-compatible pattern per line
#   - Lines starting with # are comments
#   - Empty lines are ignored
#   - Test/spec files are automatically excluded
#
# Examples:
#   src/engine/
#   src/utils/scoring.js
#   src/hooks/useSignals.js
#   api/core/
#
# Fill this file after Phase 1 when core business logic files are identified.
